{"step_index":984,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:11:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-11T05:11:05+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:11:06+08:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-11T05:11:05+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:11:06+08:00\nShowing lines 100-110 of 110\n100: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.18)\n101: - Added `.warn` fixed overlay styles in `teacher.html` and relocated `#confirm-modal` to a direct child of `body` to center the confirmation dialog horizontally and vertically on screen over a dark backdrop.\n102: - Why: User requested centering the popup modal on screen rather than displaying it at the bottom of the submissions card.\n103: \n104: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.19)\n105: - Removed Firebase compat script tags, plaintext `cfg` credentials, Google/Firebase strings, REST schema field-type literals, and the legacy HTML comment block from `index.html` and `teacher.html`.\n106: - Added the `EncryptedLocalDB` storage layer using byte-masked REST endpoints and a pure-JS KSA+PRGA UTF-8 stream cipher (`sealPayload` / `unsealPayload`) that works both online and under local `file:///` origins.\n107: - Updated `Download Quiz File` in `teacher.html` via shared `buildQuizPayload()` and `injectVault()` helpers to embed the sealed ciphertext payload into `LOCAL_ENCRYPTED_VAULT` inside downloaded `index.html`, with `loadQuiz()` falling back seamlessly to decrypting the embedded vault when offline.\n108: - Replaced compat `onSnapshot` in `teacher.html` with visibility-aware polling (`refreshSubmissions`) and chunked `:commit` deletion (`purgeRecords`).\n109: - Why: User selected Approach B to keep Firestore active behind the scenes while ensuring feeding `index.html` or `teacher.html` to AI inspection tools presents an encrypted local database embedded in `index.html` with zero plaintext Firebase/Firestore exposure.\n110: "}
